<title>UK: Woolwich B/S sets $300 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Woolwich B/S sets $300 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WOOLWICH BUILDING SOCIETY</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     6.25 BP   PAY DATE    03.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.923    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    99.923</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	CALL AT PAR FROM DECEMBER 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
